}

W -> S.1: worker poll
C.1 -> S.1: Signal that\ntriggers an Activity
S.1."Signal\nwritten to\nhistory"
S.1 -> C.1: Ack
S.1 -> W.1: Signal that\ntriggers an Activity
C."When is the Activity done?\nHow do I get the result?"
W.1."Signal handler\n\nschedule Activity\n...Activity Worker...\nreceive Activity result"
W.1."How to notify Client\nthat Activity is done\n and deliver result?"
